      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The treatment of chronic neuropathic pain with revision surgical procedures can be beneficial. A thorough evaluation can help to guide treatment to optimize outcome. With an increasing understanding of the pain-generating mechanisms and the appropriate application of surgical interventions, quality of life and function continues to be improved in patients who have otherwise significant disability."},
